@startuml components
title MixP Toolbox 0.1.2 — UML 组件图
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial Unicode MS"

package "mixp-toolbox.exe（单进程）" {
  component "应用入口\nMixpToolbox.cpp\nWinMain()" as App
  component "窗口与交互\nsrc/MainWindow.cpp\nWindow / dialogProc / runMainWindow" as UI
  component "注册表存储\nsrc/MenuRegistry.cpp\nmixp::RegistryStore" as Store
  component "命令与快照辅助函数\nsrc/MenuRegistry.cpp\nbuildCommand / splitCommand / sameTree" as Helpers
  artifact "数据类型声明\nsrc/MenuRegistry.h\nEntry / Draft / Tree / Value / Error" as Model
  artifact "已编译的对话框资源\nMixpToolbox.rc / src/resource.h\nIDD_MAIN" as DialogResource
}

package "Windows XP 系统接口" {
  component "窗口和消息\nUSER32" as User32
  component "列表与工具提示\nCOMCTL32" as Comctl32
  component "文件选择对话框\nCOMDLG32" as Comdlg32
  component "Unicode 注册表 API\nADVAPI32" as Advapi32
  component "文件与目录 API\nKERNEL32" as Kernel32
  component "Shell 接口\nSHELL32" as Shell32
}

database "注册表\nHKCU / HKLM\nSoftware\\Classes\\<object>\\shell\\<verb>" as Registry
folder "本地文件\n自动备份 / 手动导出\nUTF-16LE .reg" as RegFiles
component "Windows Explorer" as Explorer
component "regedit.exe" as Regedit
actor "用户" as User

User --> UI : 查询 / 搜索 / 增删改 / 导出
App --> Store : 构造 RegistryStore
App --> UI : runMainWindow(instance, store, show)
UI ..> DialogResource : CreateDialogParamW(IDD_MAIN)
UI --> User32 : 窗口、消息、控件文本和布局
UI --> Comctl32 : ListView / Tooltip
UI --> Comdlg32 : 浏览程序 / 选择导出文件
UI --> Store : listAll / list / objectFor\ncreate / update / remove / exportEntry
UI --> Helpers : 生成 / 拆分命令、搜索文本
Store --> Helpers : sameTree() 校验原始快照
UI ..> Model : Entry / Draft / Error
Store ..> Model : Tree / Value / Entry / Error
Store --> Advapi32 : RegOpen / RegEnum / RegSet / RegDelete
Advapi32 --> Registry : 读取和修改菜单子树
Store --> Kernel32 : 创建目录、写入 .reg 文件
Kernel32 --> RegFiles : 写文件和失败时清理
Store --> Shell32 : SHGetFolderPathW 获取备份目录
UI --> Shell32 : SHChangeNotify(SHCNE_ASSOCCHANGED)
Shell32 ..> Explorer : 通知关联配置发生变化
Explorer ..> Registry : Shell 使用注册表配置
User --> Regedit : 手动打开备份文件恢复
Regedit ..> RegFiles : 读取 .reg 文件
Regedit --> Registry : 删除指定分支后导入快照

note bottom of DialogResource
  主界面由 Win32 资源模板加载。
  当前工程没有 VCL TForm 或 .dfm。
end note

note bottom of Store
  修改、删除前：checkCurrent() → backup() → 写入。
  导出前也校验快照；新增不创建自动备份。
  图中的辅助函数与 RegistryStore 位于同一源文件，
  组件框表示职责划分，不表示独立 DLL 或服务。
end note

note bottom of Registry
  按来源分别读取 HKCU 和 HKLM，不将同名项合成一项。
  管理 shell 静态项；不枚举 shellex COM 动态扩展。
end note
@enduml
